#: contact.php:4 menu.inc:14
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Osoba"

#: contact.php:10
msgid "You can contact the Okular team in many ways."
msgstr "Možete kontaktirati Okular tim na više načina."

#: contact.php:13
msgid "Mailing list"
msgstr "Dopisna lista"

#: contact.php:16
msgid ""
"We have a mailing list to coordinate the Okular development. The mailing "
"list\n"
"is <a href='https://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/okular-devel'>okular-"
"devel</a>\n"
"and hosted at kde.org."
msgstr ""
"Imamo dopisnu listu za koordinaciju Okular razvoja. Dopisna lista \n"
"je <a href='https://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/okular-devel'>okular-"
"devel</a>\n"
"i postavljena je na kde.org."

#: contact.php:20
msgid ""
"You can use it to talk about the development of the core application, but "
"also\n"
"feedback about existent or new backends is appreciated."
msgstr ""
"Možete je koristiti da razgovarate o razvoju jezgra aplikacije, ali također\n"
"dobrodošla je i povratna informacija o postojećim ili novim programima."

#: contact.php:24
msgid "IRC"
msgstr "IRC"

#: contact.php:27
msgid ""
"We have also an IRC channel where talk. The channel is\n"
"<a href='irc://irc.kde.org/#okular'>#okular</a>, on the\n"
"<a href='http://www.freenode.net'>Freenode</a> network."
msgstr ""
"Također imamo i IRC kanal za razgovor. Kanal je \n"
"<a href='irc://irc.kde.org/#okular'>#okular</a>, na\n"
"<a href='http://www.freenode.net'>Freenode</a> mreži."

#: contact.php:31
msgid "Usually some of the Okular developers hang there."
msgstr "Obično je tamo neko od Okular developera."

#: contact.php:34
msgid "Forum"
msgstr "Forum"

#: contact.php:37
msgid ""
"If you prefer using a forum you can use <a href='http://forum.kde.org/"
"viewforum.php?f=251'>the Okular forum</a> inside the bigger <a href='http://"
"forum.kde.org/'>KDE Community Forums</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ako preferirate korištenje foruma možete koristiti <a href='http://forum.kde."
"org/viewforum.php?f=251'> Okular forum </a> unutar veće <a href='http://"
"forum.kde.org/'> KDE zajednice foruma </a>."

#: contact.php:40
msgid "Bugs and Wishes"
msgstr "Greške i želje"

#: contact.php:43
msgid ""
"Bugs and Wishes should be reported to the KDE bug tracker at <a href='http://"
"bugs.kde.org'>http://bugs.kde.org</a>."
msgstr ""
"Greške i želje trebaju biti prijavljene KDE tragaču grešaka na  <a "
"href='http://bugs.kde.org'>http://bugs.kde.org</a>."

