#: faq.php:14
msgid ""
"The Poppler backend does not compile. It complains about 'class Poppler::"
"TextBox' and 'edge'."
msgstr ""
"Pozadina Popplera se ne sastavlja. Greška je u 'class Poppler::TextBox' and "
"'edge'."

#: faq.php:15
msgid "Do you get an error output similar to"
msgstr "Dobijate li grešku na izlazu sličnu"

#: faq.php:39
msgid ""
"If so, most probably you updated from Poppler 0.6.x or previous to Poppler "
"0.8."
msgstr ""
"Ako je tako, vjerovatno ste nadogradili sa Poppler 0.6.x ili prethodnu na "
"Poppler 0.8."

#: faq.php:41
msgid "What you can do is simple:"
msgstr "Ono šta možete uraditi je jednostavno:"

#: faq.php:43
msgid ""
"in the build directory of Okular. Then run cmake again, and all should work "
"as expected."
msgstr ""
"u direktoriju izgradnje Okulara. Zatim ponovo pokrenite cmake i sve bi "
"trebalo raditi kako se očekuje."

#: faq.php:45
msgid "Running Okular"
msgstr "Pokretanje Okulara"

#: faq.php:47
msgid "Okular tells me there are no plugins installed. What can I do?"
msgstr "Okular mi kaže da dodaci nisu instalirani. Šta mogu učiniti?"

#: faq.php:48
msgid "In a shell set up for your KDE 4 installation, execute the command"
msgstr "U školjci postavke vaše KDE 4 instalacije izvršite komandu"

#: faq.php:50
msgid "After that, Okular should find its plugins as expected."
msgstr "Zatim bi Okular trebao pronaći svoje dodatke kao što je očekivano."

#: faq.php:52
msgid "General usage"
msgstr "Generalna upotreba"

#: faq.php:54
msgid "Why the newly added annotations are not in my PDF document?"
msgstr "Zašto novije dodane bilješke nisu u mom PDF dokumentu?"

#: faq.php:55
msgid ""
"By default, Okular saves annotations in the local data directory\n"
"for each user. Since KDE 4.9, it's optionally possible to store them "
"directly in\n"
"a PDF file by choosing \"File -&gt; Save As...\", so they can be seen in "
"other\n"
"PDF viewers."
msgstr ""
"Podrazumijevano, Okular čuva zabilješke u lokalnom direktoriju podataka\n"
"za svakog korisnika. Od KDE 4.9 opcionalno je moguće sačuvati ih direktno u\n"
"PDF datoteku, izborom \"Datoteka -&gt; Snimi kao...\", tako da mogu biti "
"viđeni u drugim\n"
"PDF preglednicima."

#: faq.php:60
msgid ""
"Note that this feature requires Poppler 0.20 or newer for regular PDF\n"
"documents. If the PDF document you are annotating is encrypted, this "
"feature\n"
"requires Poppler 0.22 or newer."
msgstr ""
"Zapamtite da ova osobina zahtijeva Poppler 0.20 ili noviji za regularan PDF\n"
"dokument. Ako je PDF dokument koji označavate šifrovan, ova osobina\n"
"zahtijeva Poppler 0.22 ili noviji."

#: faq.php:64
msgid "How can I annotate a document and send it to a friend/colleague/etc?"
msgstr "Kako mogu označiti dokumet i poslati ga prijatelju/kolegi/itd?"

#: faq.php:65
msgid ""
"Since KDE 4.2, Okular has the \"document archiving\" feature. This is\n"
"an Okular-specific format for carrying the document plus various metadata\n"
"related to it (currently only annotations)."
msgstr ""
"Od KDE 4.2, Okular ima osobinu \"arhiviranje dokumenta\". Ovo je\n"
"je Okular-posebni format za nošenje dokumenta plus različitih metapodataka\n"
"koje se odnose na to (trenutno samo napomene)."

#: faq.php:69
msgid ""
"You can save a \"document archive\" from the open document by choosing "
"\"File\n"
"-&gt; Export As -&gt; Document Archive\"."
msgstr ""
"Možete sačuvati \"dokument arhiv\" iz otvorenog dokumenta izborom "
"\"Datoteka\n"
"-&gt; Izvezi kao -&gt; Dokument Arhiva\"."

#: faq.php:72
msgid ""
"To open an Okular document archive, just open it with Okular as it would be "
"eg\n"
"a PDF document."
msgstr ""
"Da otvorite Okular arhivirani dokument, samo ga otvorite preko Okulara kao "
"da je npr. PDF dokument."

#: faq.php:75
msgid ""
"If you're annotating a PDF document, you can also save annotations\n"
"directly in the PDF file (see previous question)"
msgstr ""
"Ako pravite napomene u PDF dokumentu, također ih možete spasiti direktno u "
"PDF datoteku (pogledajte prethodno pitanje)"

#: faq.php:78
msgid ""
"Using Ubuntu, I cannot read CHM and EPub documents,\n"
"even if I have okular-extra-backends and libchm1 installed. Why?"
msgstr ""
"Korištenjem Ubuntua ne mogu čitati CHM i EPub dokumente,\n"
"čak i ako imam instaliranu okular-extra-pozadinu i libchm1. Zašto?"

#: faq.php:80
msgid ""
"Ubuntu (thus Kubuntu as well) packages of Okular are compiled without\n"
"the support for these two formats."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu (također i Kubuntu) paketi Okulara su sastavljeni bez\n"
"podrške za ova dva formata."

#: faq.php:83
msgid "The reason is explained in the following Launchpad report: "
msgstr "Razlog je naveden u sljedećem Launchpad izvještaju: "

