msgstr "Okular u kdegraphics"

#: news.rdf:226
#, kde-format
msgid "Apr 4, 2007"
msgstr "4. april 2007."

#: news.rdf:229
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\t\t\t\tThe Okular team is proud to announce Okular is now part of the "
"kdegraphics module. The next version of Okular will be shipped with KDE "
"4.0.\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\t\t\t\tOkular tim s ponosom objavljuje da je Okular sada dio kdegraphics "
"modula. Sljedeća verzija Okulara će biti isporučena sa KDE 4.0.\n"
"\t\t\t"

#: news.rdf:232
#, kde-format
msgid "Okular joins The Season of Usability project"
msgstr "Okular se pridružuje projektu Sezona Upotrebljivosti"

#: news.rdf:233
#, kde-format
msgid "Jan 31, 2007"
msgstr "31. januar 2007."

#: news.rdf:236
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\t\t\t\tThe Okular team is proud to announce Okular has been one of the "
"applications selected to participate in the <a href=\"http://www."
"openusability.org/season/0607/\">Season of Usability</a> project, run by "
"usability experts at <a href=\"http://www.openusability.org\">OpenUsability</"
"a>. From here we want to welcome Sharad Baliyan to the team and thank "
"Florian Graessle and Pino Toscano for their continued work on improving "
"Okular.\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\t\t\t\tOkular tim s ponosom najavljuje da je Okular jedna od aplikacija "
"koje su izabrane da učestvuju na <a href=\"http://www.openusability.org/"
"season/0607/\">Sezona Iskoristivosti</a> projektu, koji vode stručnjaci "
"iskoristivosti na <a href=\"http://www.openusability.org\">OpenUsability</"
"a>. Ovom prilikom želimo dobrodošlicu Sharad Baliyanu u tim i želimo "
"zahvaliti Florianu Graessleu i Pinou Toscani za njihov stalni rad na "
"poboljšanju Okulara.\n"
"\t\t\t"

#: news.rdf:239
#, kde-format
msgid "Okular 0.5.81 unstable snapshot released"
msgstr "Okular 0.5.81 puštena nestabilna verzija"

#: news.rdf:240
#, kde-format
msgid "Nov 2, 2006"
msgstr "2. novembar 2006."

#: news.rdf:243
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\t\t\t\tThe Okular team is proud to announce the release of a snapshot of "
"Okular that compiles against the <a href=\"http://dot.kde.org/1162475911/"
"\">Second KDE 4 Developers Snapshot</a>. This snapshot is not completely "
"functional, yet, as we have lots of things to polish and finish, but you are "
"free to test it and provide as much feedback as you want. You can find the "
"snapshot package at <a href=\"ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/unstable/apps/KDE4.x/"
"graphics/okular-0.5.81.tar.bz2\">ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/unstable/apps/"
"KDE4.x/graphics/okular-0.5.81.tar.bz2</a>. Have a look at the <a href="
"\"download.php\">download</a> page to be sure you have all the necessary "
"libraries.\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\t\t\t\tOkular tim s ponosom najavljuje puštanje snimke Okulara koja se "
"sastavlja protiv <a href=\"http://dot.kde.org/1162475911/\">Druga KDE 4 "
"Developers Snimka</a>. Ova snimka nije u potpunosti funkcionalna, ipak, kako "
"imamo mnogo toga za završiti, slobodno testirajte i pošaljite nam povratnih "
"informacija koliko želite. Paket snimke možete pronaći na <a href=\"ftp://"
"ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/unstable/apps/KDE4.x/graphics/okular-0.5.81.tar."
"bz2\">ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/unstable/apps/KDE4.x/graphics/okular-0.5.81."
"tar.bz2</a>. Pogledajte na <a href=\"download.php\">download</a> stranicu da "
"se uvjerite da imate sve potrebne biblioteke.\n"
"\t\t\t"

